  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO ROSA Italian JPO Programme 2023/2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The JPO on Communication for Development position is for the Communication and Information Sector based at the UNESCO Harare Office. The sector runs programmes in Botswana, Eswatini, Lesotho, Malawi, Mozambique Namibia, South Africa Zambia, and Zimbabwe with programmes targeting the promotion of universal access to information and safety of media professionals; promote the expression of pluralism and cultural diversity, gender equality, climate change and resilience building through the media and promotion of universal access to ICTs (ICTs for Development) and strengthening documentary heritage.</narrative>
  </description>
